		</element>
		<element kind="textField" uuid="f9609ab6-3ef4-47fa-acd6-29e74b6138c8" x="1" y="90" width="555" height="30" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10.0" textAdjust="StretchHeight">
			<expression><![CDATA["เงื่อนไข / ข้อตกลง (Terms and Conditions)\n\n" +

"1. Partners of agreement are accepted in terms and conditions as below.\n" +
"2. Enter this order in accordance with the prices, terms, Delivery method, and specifications listed above.\n" +
"3. Please notify us immediately if you are unable to ship as specified.\n" +
"4. Occasionally, the delivered quantity and order quantity might be different by 10% at maximum, the payment will aligned by the quantity after buyer's checked.\n" +
"5. Payment method is deposite for 40% then another 60% before shipping.\n" +
"6. After confirmed and tested the specification as above, the process lead time is  about 30-40 days.\n" +
"7. Supplier provide a free delivery service in Guang Zhou district.\n" +
"8. In case of Seller cannot deliver products to Buyer on agreed date, Buyer reserves the right to charge Seller five percent (5%) of the shipset price per delayed week.\n" +
"9. In the event of seller supply nonconforming or defective products. Any such warranted product, or parts thereof, rendered unserviceable by its nonconformance shall be replaced by Seller\n" +
"10. All shipping expenses, insurance costs, duties, taxes or any other charges incurred as a result of the return of the products to Seller shall be borne by and pay by Seller.\n" +
"11. Supplier provide a quality control service and guarantee their products. In case of the products damaged or defected, Buyer can reject and change product if its found within 15 days after received the products.\n" +
"12. Buyer will attached the photo of damaged product to supplier for claimed the new product.\n" +
"13. Buyer will checked and confirmed the quantity of products after received within 15-30 days.\n" +
"14. This purchase order will effectived when its signed by authorized and stamped.\n" +
"15. Supplier must provide a Certificate of Analysis (COA) and clearly specify the material specifications of the product each time before delivery.\n" +
"16. The supplier must label the Purchase Order (PO) number, as stated in the official document, on every shipping carton before delivery.\n"]]></expression>
			<box topPadding="2" leftPadding="5" bottomPadding="2" rightPadding="5">
				<topPen lineWidth="0.5" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				<leftPen lineWidth="0.5" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				<bottomPen lineWidth="0.5" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				<rightPen lineWidth="0.5" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
			</box>
		</element>
